{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0045","paragraphs":[{"id":"p27957d88cd7e-1","text":"十年生死两茫茫。"},{"id":"pff5a954527eb-1","text":"不思量。"},{"id":"p83e081ea08e6-1","text":"自难忘。"},{"id":"pecbc563fe1ca-1","text":"千里孤坟，无处话凄凉。"},{"id":"p1fde7f2aad6e-1","text":"纵使相逢应不识，尘满面，鬓如霜。"},{"id":"paec9adc61906-1","text":"夜来幽梦忽还乡。"},{"id":"pa81f2d5043c5-1","text":"小轩窗。"},{"id":"pe6e75cb8d839-1","text":"正梳妆。"},{"id":"paee965d59c0b-1","text":"相顾无言，惟有泪千行。"},{"id":"pbcabd89e1d0a-1","text":"料得年年断肠处，明月夜，短松冈。"}]}